    },
    {
      "_id": "22",
      "session_id": "demo-b-s03",
      "sequence_id": 23,
      "role": "TUTOR",
      "content": "Good — let's dig into the equation itself now.",
      "turn_id": "demo-b-s03-t023"
    },
    {
      "_id": "23",
      "session_id": "demo-b-s03",
      "sequence_id": 24,
      "role": "STUDENT_1",
      "content": "Let's think through the actual equation now, not just the idea.",
      "turn_id": "demo-b-s03-t024"
    },
    {
      "_id": "24",
      "session_id": "demo-b-s03",
      "sequence_id": 25,
      "role": "TUTOR",
      "content": "Right, so what does the left side become once we expand it?",
      "turn_id": "demo-b-s03-t025"
    },
    {
      "_id": "25",
      "session_id": "demo-b-s03",
      "sequence_id": 26,
      "role": "STUDENT_1",
      "content": "5 times x is 5x, and 5 times 3 is 15, so it's 5x minus 15.",
      "turn_id": "demo-b-s03-t026"
    },
    {
      "_id": "26",
      "session_id": "demo-b-s03",
      "sequence_id": 27,
      "role": "TUTOR",
      "content": "Good, so now the equation reads 5x - 15 = 2x + 9.",
      "turn_id": "demo-b-s03-t027"
    },
    {
      "_id": "27",
      "session_id": "demo-b-s03",
      "sequence_id": 28,
      "role": "STUDENT_1",
      "content": "Both sides have x, so we need to get them together somehow.",
      "turn_id": "demo-b-s03-t028"
    },
    {
      "_id": "28",
      "session_id": "demo-b-s03",
      "sequence_id": 29,
      "role": "TUTOR",
      "content": "Since 2x is the smaller x term, subtracting it from both sides keeps things positive.",
      "turn_id": "demo-b-s03-t029"
    },
    {
      "_id": "29",
      "session_id": "demo-b-s03",
      "sequence_id": 30,
      "role": "STUDENT_1",
      "content": "So we'd end up with just 3x on the left after that subtraction.",
      "turn_id": "demo-b-s03-t030"
    },
    {
      "_id": "30",
      "session_id": "demo-b-s03",
      "sequence_id": 31,
      "role": "TUTOR",
      "content": "Let's just pause a second before writing anything down.",
      "turn_id": "demo-b-s03-t031"
    },
    {
      "_id": "31",
      "session_id": "demo-b-s03",
      "sequence_id": 32,
      "role": "STUDENT_1",
      "content": "Sure, one sec.",
      "turn_id": "demo-b-s03-t032"
    },
    {
      "_id": "32",
